msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates how to solve the Market Split problem using [Kipu"
" Quantum's Iskay quantum optimizer](/guides/kipu-optimization) "
"[\\[1\\]](#references). The Market Split problem represents a real-world "
"resource allocation challenge where markets must be partitioned into "
